# - Assigned Quality Inspector field routes complaints to the proper quality user.
# - Adds hard permission hooks to bypass owner/user-permission filtering for allowed roles.
# - Keeps login redirect behavior: quality users still land on /quality-desk, but can open Desk complaint forms.
# - Does NOT touch report_api / CDR / Elastix logic except health checks.

